{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13561","headline":"鲍防员外见寻因书情呈赠 · 秦系","name":"鲍防员外见寻因书情呈赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少小爲儒不自强，如今嬾复见侯王。\n览镜已知身渐老，买山将作计偏长。\n荒凉鸟兽同三迳，撩乱琴书共一牀。\n犹有郎官来问疾，时人莫道我佯狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}